{"posts":[{"id":"whenever_p3_51","t":"...didn't think that News were going to happen very shortly after setting some POs... I was thinking: \" well...if I think to know what Price is probably going to do...why not to trade that?\"\n\nLesson got: always also put TP (and SL) by setting the POs I saw my levels getting triggered and the levels I wanted to reach as TP within a few seconds!!! Closed manually what and when I could...but just in a kind of Panic... Regular TP would have got much better Results...\n\nBefore...\n\nAfter....\n\nNot a bad result anyway...","a":"Whenever","d":"","n":"#51","p":3,"im":["458466b57eda95356f27893cdcaf75e3227811b2","821a7889690d8b68e6eb36fa0c34d6272a6dffa9"],"m":51},{"id":"whenever_p3_52","t":"I have to demo accounts.\n\n* One at work where I can only look for some seconds from time to time... and do crazy things for short scalping tests (like the one above), as it is just a kind of short \"relax moment\" from the work.\n\n* One at home, where I look at HTF mostly, and try to handle like I will do with a real account (because that's the goal of all the effort).\n\nThis is a PO ( which will be my only possibility of setting trades) I was looking at, since 6th of April.\n\nIt seems that we are getting there now. It will probably be triggered next week.\n\nI made a mistake anyway (now market are closed, so I cannot change it): I didn't set a SL...that's something I WON'T do with my real account. (Instead I will also probably set a TP)\n\nThis is my analysis for the moment. I am very curious about the result.\n\nThe bigger Picture:\n\nSome details of Approach:","a":"Whenever","d":"","n":"#52","p":3,"im":["cec4299f7c45737859a4dbfd0b99e46ecd8a793b","f61191cd96eadd83813982fc24ee35be1481aa9c","18ecd7f51a3487f9da00926f9a1bb146df54d602"],"m":52},{"id":"whenever_p3_53","t":"Glad to see it would have worked. Actually it really did, but I was not at my PC for following PA properly and close when it was time to.\n\nUpdate","a":"Whenever","d":"","n":"#53","p":3,"im":["29e0b3a08979bdeb574aa6da8190bf20bda17ff3","2367dc58328c0fda1b368cb7e3165c495516748f"],"m":53},{"id":"whenever_p3_54","t":"Hi Whenever,\n\ndid you get any PA or clues that price wants to go down or you just basically touch trade and hope that price will reverse?\n\nWhere are your FL's? Are they broken?\n\nThis is how I see it:\n\nFL's are respected nicely and haven't been broken yet. So, no short signal for me","a":"forexlit","d":"","n":"#54","p":3,"im":["3595fa8fda5a07fc417d7274344aed9c2014e09a"],"m":54},{"id":"whenever_p3_55","t":"Hi Forexlit,\n\nPA and FL are in post #52. They are on a bigger scale than yours. But I quite agree with your reading too in your analyzed TF.\n\nNo, I \"lost my hope\" already years ago about trading Which is actually a good thing. The first trade was a PO ( TT ), as I have no time to follow the chart.\n\nSo I have no way to look at charts all the time and reading approach and rejection in detail in LTF. It would have been good for about 50 pips at least, but lesson was to settle always a TP and SL accordingly. Greed is one of the hardest monsters to face.\n\nSecond was a scalp of a few pips made for enjoying the few minutes available at chart.","a":"Whenever","d":"","n":"#55","p":3,"im":[],"m":55},{"id":"whenever_p3_56","t":"","a":"Whenever","d":"","n":"#56","p":3,"im":["7aba5f22fa0d55cc564d0fefb5fffa2dbfe36a36"],"m":56},{"id":"whenever_p3_57","t":"","a":"Whenever","d":"","n":"#57","p":3,"im":["ebd4fb473417f2c6770a99f43f1e7ef9627ee919"],"m":57},{"id":"whenever_p3_58","t":"","a":"Whenever","d":"","n":"#58","p":3,"im":["cc4d6163db60ad3447f59241ac6b8c2ad6c27f52"],"m":58},{"id":"whenever_p3_59","t":"I may be wrong, but experience teaches me that, if you cannot follow the charts live, you better handle conservatively... You never know what you can find when you get back home. Anyway 128 pips are secured.","a":"Whenever","d":"","n":"#59","p":3,"im":["6e6a5d379a7ad4c6a70f1e3f2c3ed011116afc18"],"m":59},{"id":"whenever_p3_60","t":"...just another couple of those and it will get time to invest some little money in stopping playing games and starting trading... what I am finding out for my own style is: the simplest the better. (and these two are even a bit too \"aggressive ones\", due to available time) What I liked in the second trade was the strong move up into the upper Flag, followed by weakness: smell of FO. And it seemed to be correct.","a":"Whenever","d":"","n":"#60","p":3,"im":["6a78c95f9c291554b99b196754a007a58793d73a"],"m":60},{"id":"whenever_p3_61","t":"..about trusting the own analisys...\n\nBut I think I have to say that after a bit an exciting start, looking at 104 trades (a little toooo many, I know) in one month ( demo account opened on April 24th ), something seems to be changing in my way of trading. Proud of my progress","a":"Whenever","d":"","n":"#61","p":3,"im":["bf5af490888bdd28a54e804741aedc5ea8fa3d20","e3892de9de62d906ffb11b289cc3265ffdbe97de"],"m":61},{"id":"whenever_p3_62","t":"Rcmaf...\n\nI warmly suggest everybody to study his very good short and silent video....\n\nwww.readthemarket.com/index.php/forum/jo...rnal?start=250#42649","a":"Whenever","d":"","n":"#62","p":3,"im":["2c4c2e3d977a79cd440235f8ad3406ab3e79e483","b383c2486370aeec5f44b5828c1c16c45aed160b"],"m":62},{"id":"whenever_p3_63","t":"well..... I did enter again after breaking into the lower CP paz....\n\nYes...really...price moves randomly All Trading is just gambling...","a":"Whenever","d":"","n":"#63","p":3,"im":["e589b55fc5ad280515d7b6f951baa275310c76a1"],"m":63},{"id":"whenever_p3_64","t":"Well done, mate. It`s nice\n\ninteresting - what next?\n\nI closed E\\U (180 pips). I want to see next step.","a":"Kovalenko","d":"","n":"#64","p":3,"im":["e28a80cc0e1082ef6acc041a12dbf07835676a07","dc7fe9dfdd46e3b0076d2d4dbb574cd2e16350cc"],"m":64},{"id":"whenever_p3_65","t":"Thank you Sir Kovalenko! Said from you it's a lot worth to me.","a":"Whenever","d":"","n":"#65","p":3,"im":["57ffb1fc1c14fb7b4078a870bd46bd45ea3c1b90"],"m":65},{"id":"whenever_p3_66","t":"For me - main indicator is Index $. now you see price is in Trouble area (main key level). I want to see the confirmation on H1","a":"Kovalenko","d":"","n":"#66","p":3,"im":["0d5670599c5b385823a6f982913702fa5fa14f6a"],"m":66},{"id":"whenever_p3_67","t":"Thanks, I'll surely look at that in future. Never done till now... My demo broker has no Index...will have to look for one with that.\n\n(any suggestion?)","a":"Whenever","d":"","n":"#67","p":3,"im":[],"m":67},{"id":"whenever_p3_68","t":"I look at Index $ (Instaforex broker).","a":"Kovalenko","d":"","n":"#68","p":3,"im":[],"m":68},{"id":"whenever_p3_69","t":"","a":"Whenever","d":"","n":"#69","p":3,"im":["c67da39d7fe8c9e57a175d184feca9e8b8a6f72e"],"m":69},{"id":"whenever_p3_71","t":"","a":"Whenever","d":"","n":"#71","p":3,"im":["fabb8a042105e334577ef404e91b35aaff244c2e","f93041d6a327d9a1c511d836027eb42859554022"],"m":71},{"id":"whenever_p3_72","t":"","a":"Whenever","d":"","n":"#72","p":3,"im":["d165fd53d42cb381f61ba51df9db478f020d22ab"],"m":72},{"id":"whenever_p3_73","t":"Whenever wrote:\n\nHas been waiting for your post!","a":"jiemisii","d":"","n":"#73","p":3,"im":["d165fd53d42cb381f61ba51df9db478f020d22ab"],"m":73},{"id":"whenever_p3_74","t":"","a":"Whenever","d":"","n":"#74","p":3,"im":["e1c8a20f79f88e47a02f5efa98297540f07e14de"],"m":74},{"id":"whenever_p3_75","t":"Fast adding for 22 pips Rest still running and 114 pips locked in.","a":"Whenever","d":"","n":"#75","p":3,"im":["bad3d873a436a494055a4e4b9564268e31ee2fbd"],"m":75}],"images":[{"k":"458466b57eda95356f27893cdcaf75e3227811b2","t":"assets/thumbs/458466b57eda95356f27893cdcaf75e3227811b2.webp","f":"assets/images/458466b57eda95356f27893cdcaf75e3227811b2.jpeg","w":1590,"h":749,"b":87674,"o":"458466b57eda95356f27893cdcaf75e3227811b2.jpeg","p":3,"pid":"whenever_p3_51"},{"k":"821a7889690d8b68e6eb36fa0c34d6272a6dffa9","t":"assets/thumbs/821a7889690d8b68e6eb36fa0c34d6272a6dffa9.webp","f":"assets/images/821a7889690d8b